00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,700
The Great Wall costs about $20 to visit yourself. I'm your China Travel Expert.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,100
Tour desks quote $90 to $120 a person.

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:07,600
So where does all that money actually go?

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
Entry at Mutianyu is just 40 yuan — about six dollars.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,500
A round-trip express bus from Beijing: 80 yuan.

6
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,100
Add the 15-yuan shuttle and you're near $20 total.

7
00:00:15,100 --> 00:00:17,600
Double-tap if you'd skip the tour and go solo.

8
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,200
The tour buys you a driver — not a cheaper wall.

9
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:22,800
★ Expert Tip: buy the 40-yuan ticket on the official site.

10
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:25,600
$120 tour or $20 on your own — which are you booking?
